{"id":46897,"date":"2025-11-26T09:12:48","date_gmt":"2025-11-26T08:12:48","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=46897"},"modified":"2026-08-23T16:38:59","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T15:38:59","slug":"sao-silvestre-chaves","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-chaves\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre Chaves 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: PROVA S\u00c3O SILVESTRE DE CHAVES 2025 --><\/p>\n<div  style=\"max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 16px 60px 16px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<p>  <!-- M\u00d3DULO 1: SOBRE O EVENTO --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.45); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(22px, 4vw, 30px); color: #FFF; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 800;\">Sobre a <span  style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Chaves<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n      A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de Chaves 2025<\/strong> reuniu centenas de atletas e entusiastas do atletismo nas ruas hist\u00f3ricas da cidade de Chaves, no distrito de Vila Real. Realizada a 27 de Dezembro de 2025, a prova celebrou o encerramento do ano desportivo com um percurso vibrante que cruzou a ic\u00f3nica Ponte Romana e o centro hist\u00f3rico flaviense.\n    <\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n      Com partida e chegada na zona nobre da cidade, o evento combinou a vertente competitiva da corrida de 10 km com a componente de lazer da caminhada de 7 km, atraindo participantes de todo o Norte de Portugal e da vizinha Galiza.\n    <\/p>\n<\/section>\n<p>  <!-- M\u00d3DULO 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: #C4B5FD; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 800;\">\u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica do Evento<\/h2>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\">\n<div style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Data Realizada<\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #FFF; font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px;\">27 de Dezembro de 2025<\/div>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\">\n<div style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Localiza\u00e7\u00e3o<\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #FFF; font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px;\">Chaves, Vila Real<\/div>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\">\n<div style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #FFF; font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px;\">Corrida 10 km | Caminhada 7 km<\/div>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\">\n<div style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Piso &#038; Terreno<\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #FFF; font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px;\">Asfalto e Cal\u00e7ada Portuguesa<\/div>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<\/section>\n<p>  <!-- M\u00d3DULO 3: GEOMETRIA & PERCURSO --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.45); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: #FFF; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 800;\">\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da Prova &#038; Percurso<\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n      O circuito urbano da S\u00e3o Silvestre de Chaves \u00e9 caracterizado por um perfil maioritariamente plano a ligeiramente ondulado, ideal para atletas que procuram testar o seu ritmo de final de \u00e9poca. O tra\u00e7ado percorre as margens do Rio T\u00e2mega e penetra no centro hist\u00f3rico, exigindo aten\u00e7\u00e3o acrescida no tro\u00e7o de empedrado tradicional junto ao Castelo.\n    <\/p>\n<\/section>\n<p>  <!-- M\u00d3DULO 4: BANNER CALCULADORA DE PACE --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0%, rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.25) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; color: #FFF; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f Quer calcular o seu tempo estimado de corrida?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Utilize a nossa calculadora interativa para simular o seu ritmo por quil\u00f3metro.<\/p>\n<p>    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B5CF6 0%, #6D28D9 100%); color: #FFF; font-weight: 800; border-radius: 20px; padding: 10px 28px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; font-size: 14px;\">Aceder \u00e0 Calculadora de Pace \u2197<\/a><br \/>\n  <\/section>\n<p>  <!-- M\u00d3DULO 5: ONDE FICAR --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.45); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: #FFF; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 800;\">\ud83c\udfe8 Onde Ficar em Chaves<\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n      A cidade de Chaves disp\u00f5e de uma excelente oferta hoteleira, com destaque para os hot\u00e9is termais pr\u00f3ximos das Caldas de Chaves e as unidades de alojamento local no centro hist\u00f3rico, permitindo desloca\u00e7\u00f5es a p\u00e9 para a zona de partida da prova.\n    <\/p>\n<\/section>\n<p>  <!-- M\u00d3DULO 6: SOBRE O LOCAL & GASTRONOMIA --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.45); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: #FFF; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 800;\">\ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &#038; Gastronomia Regional<\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n      Visitar Chaves por ocasi\u00e3o da S\u00e3o Silvestre \u00e9 uma oportunidade para saborear os famosos <strong>Past\u00e9is de Chaves<\/strong> (com Indica\u00e7\u00e3o Geogr\u00e1fica Protegida) e o tradicional Presunto de Chaves, perfeitos para o reposto energ\u00e9tico p\u00f3s-prova.\n    <\/p>\n<\/section>\n<p>  <!-- M\u00d3DULO 7: FAQS --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.45); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px;\">\n<h2  style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #FFF; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 800;\">Perguntas <span  style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes<\/span><\/h2>\n<div  style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;\">\n<details  style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n<summary  style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #FFF; cursor: pointer;\">Onde consultar os resultados da S\u00e3o Silvestre de Chaves 2025?<\/summary>\n<div  style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">Os tempos oficiais e classifica\u00e7\u00f5es da edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2025 podem ser consultados na plataforma oficial de cronometragem do evento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details  style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n<summary  style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #FFF; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tipo de terreno do percurso?<\/summary>\n<div  style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">O percurso \u00e9 100% urbano, alternando entre asfalto de piso r\u00e1pido e cal\u00e7ada portuguesa no centro hist\u00f3rico.<\/div>\n<\/details><\/div>\n<\/section>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL --><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":46898,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,28,624,47],"event_type_2":[726,64],"event_type_3":[744],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-46897","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-chaves-vila-real","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-kids","event_type-sao-silvestre","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-vila-real","event_type_3-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/sschaves25_banner-1024x360.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/46897","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=46897"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/46897\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":61346,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/46897\/revisions\/61346"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/46898"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=46897"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=46897"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type?post=46897"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_2","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_2?post=46897"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_3","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_3?post=46897"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_4","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_4?post=46897"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_5","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_5?post=46897"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}